<div id="formulaPop" class="popup"><button onclick="closePop('formulaPop')">Close</button><h3>Formula Sheet - SMS 3463</h3><p><b>Return:</b> r_t = ln(P_t / P_{t-1}) or (P_t - P_{t-1}) / P_{t-1} | <b>AR(1):</b> Y_t = c + phi Y_{t-1} + e_t | <b>MA(1):</b> Y_t = mu + e_t + theta e_{t-1} | <b>ARMA(1,1):</b> Y_t = c + phi Y_{t-1} + e_t + theta e_{t-1} | <b>ARIMA:</b> ARIMA(p,d,q) - d = times differenced | <b>Stationary AR(1):</b> |phi| &lt; 1, Mean = c / (1 - phi), Var = sigma^2 / (1 - phi^2) | <b>ARCH(1):</b> sigma_t^2 = alpha_0 + alpha_1 e_{t-1}^2 | <b>GARCH(1,1):</b> sigma_t^2 = alpha_0 + alpha_1 e_{t-1}^2 + beta sigma_{t-1}^2 | <b>Forecast:</b> AR(1) 1-step = c + phi Y_t | <b>ACF:</b> rho_k = Cov(Y_t, Y_{t-k}) / Var(Y_t)</p></div>
<div id="glossPop" class="popup"><button onclick="closePop('glossPop')">Close</button><h3>Glossary - SMS 3463</h3><p><b>Time series:</b> data in time order. <b>Return:</b> change in price. <b>Stationary:</b> mean and variance do not change over time. <b>White noise:</b> random, no pattern, mean 0. <b>AR:</b> today depends on past values. <b>MA:</b> today depends on past shocks. <b>ARMA:</b> AR + MA. <b>ARIMA:</b> ARMA after differencing. <b>Differencing:</b> subtract yesterday from today to make stationary. <b>Volatility:</b> how much price jumps. <b>ARCH / GARCH:</b> models where volatility changes over time. <b>Forecast:</b> prediction of future value. <b>ACF:</b> correlation with past values. <b>【entity-NSE¦canonical_name=NSE】:</b> Nairobi Securities Exchange.</p></div>
