<div id="ownChat">
<h3 id="chatTitle">Our Own Chatbox</h3>
<div class="msg" id="chatGuide">Hi! I am your SPAS marking guide. Do this question manually on paper, step by step. Take a clear photo of YOUR WORKING and upload it below. You will see a preview. Then type your (a), (b), (c) answers. I will guide you by part.</div>
<p><strong>1. Upload your working (photo of your manual work):</strong><br><input type="file" accept="image/*" onchange="previewPhoto(this)"><br><img id="photoPreview"></p>
<p><strong>2. Type your answers here:</strong><br><input id="chatInput" style="padding:10px;width:90%" placeholder="Type your answer"></p>
<p><button onclick="sendInChat()">Send in Our Chatbox</button> <button onclick="sendToMeta()">Send to Meta AI for Real Marking</button> <button onclick="tickFromChat()">AI Marked Me Correct - Tick</button> <button onclick="closeOwnChat()">Close Chatbox</button></p>
<p id="chatLog"></p>
<p><small>Our Chatbox guides you. For real AI marking, click Send to Meta AI - it copies question + answers + rubric for you to paste in Meta AI chat.</small></p>
